OL,4,Amigrant plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo-hundred-and-fifty-seven people -
OL,7,F94% of those who took part ` voted in
OL,8,Ffavour of leaving, 16 voted against and
OL,9,Fone vote was spoiled.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
