OL,3,AFight over fossil fuels leaves COP31
OL,4,Aclimate talks in deadlock
OL,5,
OL,6,FNegotiations at the COP31 UN climate
OL,7,Fsummit in Turkey are in deadlock and
OL,8,Fhave been suspended for the night,
OL,9,Fafter running more than a day over
OL,10,Ftime, as countries have been unable to
OL,11,Fagree on a new global climate deal.
OL,13,FThe EU and Pacific island nations are
OL,14,Famongst a group pushing back against
OL,15,Fthe latest draft agreement which
OL,16,Fincluded no reference to reducing the
OL,17,Fworld's demand for fossil fuels.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
