OL,3,AMexican drug lord on FBI's 10 most
OL,4,Awanted list arrested in shoot-out
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Mexican drug lord who was on the
OL,7,FFBI's 10 most wanted list has been
OL,8,Farrested following a shoot-out with
OL,9,FMexican authorities.
OL,11,FFausto Isidro "Chapo Isidro" Meza
OL,12,FFlores and seven others were detained
OL,13,Fby Mexican special forces in Guasave,
OL,14,FSinaloa on Friday, Mexico's defence
OL,15,Fsecretariat said.
OL,17,FSeven suspects were killed in the
OL,18,Foperation, as were four members of the
OL,19,FMexican army who were travelling to
OL,20,Freinforce security in Guasave, the
OL,21,Fsecretariat added.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
